  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1186851434663264376/ec_alexs_caves_plugin.png?ex=6594c088&amp;is=65824b88&amp;hm=e8844a8404157bfa373dd8913772510b313c91af8171fcc68381e6d46e6715b4&amp;\" alt=\"Expanded Combat Alex's Caves Plugin 标题图片\" width=\"1023\" height=\"249\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fec-alexs-caves-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Modrinth 上可用\" width=\"187\" height=\"64\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.2/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Cloth Config API\" width=\"242\" height=\"64\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152401406247047188/curios_api_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Curios API\" width=\"205\" height=\"64\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152636014880366763/expanded_combat_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Expanded Combat\" width=\"288\" height=\"64\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1186851392644714516/alexs-caves_64h.png?ex=6594c07e&amp;is=65824b7e&amp;hm=102c1940e71bd7611388516152f5c2a832946590b49f46176b90af9a5c495823&amp;\" alt=\"需要 Alex's Caves\" width=\"235\" height=\"64\"></a></p>\n</div><p>这是一个为<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded Combat</a>制作的插件模组，新增了对<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a>的兼容性。</p><h4>新增支持：</h4><p>方铅矿护手 - 可在护手槽位使用功能<br>绯红/天青钕 - 盾牌（具有电阻盾部分效果）<br>佩文木 - 盾牌与武器<br>原始方块武器 - 采用类似原始棍棒的风格<br>坚韧兽皮 - 盾牌与护手<br>酸蚀会损坏护手<br>聚合物板 - 盾牌</p><p>暗影丝 - 盾牌与护手<br>荆棘木 - 盾牌与武器</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h5><strong>重要提示：</strong></h5><p><strong>如需报告错误，请使用GitHub上的问题追踪系统<a href=\"https://github.com/userofbricks/Expanded-Combat/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</strong></p><p><strong>其他交流需求请通过Discord<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7cR4Vwv\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;<br>点击横幅获取折扣：<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fuserofbricks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/1c1e14ee-b2b9-4507-9143-651ea30d1c04.webp\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
